WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:05.682
You measured a ring's exit criteria, took
the evidence export before the change,

3
00:00:05.682 --> 00:00:09.898
rolled the test tenant back in the
guide's order, took the export again

4
00:00:09.898 --> 00:00:14.187
to show the state after the rollback,
and removed the lab's test objects.

5
00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:16.949
The evidence an I S S O
keeps from this module:

6
00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:20.630
the ring exit record with each
criterion's measured value,

7
00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:24.310
the ring one and rolled-back
exports with their manifests,

8
00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:27.838
the rollback change record,
and the exception register.

9
00:00:27.838 --> 00:00:32.768
In production, add the CISA telemetry
agreement and the Zero Trust Assessment

10
00:00:32.768 --> 00:00:37.624
rerun after each ring, with each network
finding's closure chain entry updated.

11
00:00:37.624 --> 00:00:39.125
That completes the path.

12
00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:44.040
From here, work through the guide's
implementation checklist, one ring at a time.
